# Audit: Backend Task Survives Frontend SSE/HTTP Disconnect

**Date:** 2026-04-23
**Scope:** Frontend ↔ Backend SSE / HTTP connection disconnect (not process crash)
**Invariant (contract):**
> Once `/api/chat/start` or `/api/chat/send` returns `{taskId}`, the task MUST continue
> executing in a daemon thread and persist its result to `task_results` + `conversations.messages`
> regardless of whether the originating SSE/HTTP client is still connected.

---

